      "note": "The clause 3.6.2 example: a conjunction between an operational satellite and a Fengyun 1C debris fragment, 715 metres apart. Object 1 can manoeuvre and object 2 cannot, which is the asymmetry an operator acts on and which nothing in the format marks other than this keyword. The covariance is the obligatory 6x6; the three optional rows that would make it 9x9 are absent, and a reader must be able to tell that from rows that happen to be zero.",
